# C# Solution

```csharp
public class Solution
{
    public int MaxDepth(string s)
    {
        int parentheses = 0;
        int maxDepth = 0;

        foreach (char ch in s)
        {
            if (ch == '(')
            {
                parentheses++;
                maxDepth = Math.Max(maxDepth, parentheses);
            }
            else if (ch == ')')
            {
                parentheses--;
            }
        }

        return maxDepth;
    }
}
```
